<title>UK: Cargolux to apply cargo fuel surcharge.</title>
<headline>Cargolux to apply cargo fuel surcharge.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg-based Cargolux scheduled and charter cargo airline is introducing a 10 cents cargo fuel surcharge to all destinations with effect from November 4, its UK cargo manager Mark Boffee said.</p>
<p>From the UK, this is equal to six pence per kg, he added.</p>
<p>Cargolux operates three Boeing 747-400 freighters with a fourth due for early delivery in August 1997. It also has three Boeing 747-200s and an additional one on leaseback.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
